  "summary": [
    "Applies only when project instructions mandate uv; distributed scripts require judging the user environment burden",
    "Dependency declaration location: PEP 723 inline metadata or root pyproject.toml",
    "Run Python scripts with uv run, not system python3",
    "Add dependencies with uv add --script --bounds lower, remove with uv remove; never hand-write versions",
    "Lock with uv lock --script, commit lock file, run with uv run --locked",
    "Update with uv lock --upgrade and review the lock diff before commit",
    "Set exclude-newer = \"3 days\" in tool.uv to avoid freshly published versions",
    "Urgent security fixes use exclude-newer-package exceptions, removed afterwards",
    "requires-python lower bound follows the latest stable Python"
  ],
